          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Looking for a daily drinker that’s approachable, but still full of flavor? Our Family Series is here for you. Enjoy our deeply noted coffee blend that is likely to please everyone. Roasted to taste great with or without cream and sugar.</p><p>Our coffee subscription is curated by our expert team of coffee experts who have spent years honing their craft, and they’re ready to share their knowledge with you!</p>",
