        "template--14646129197122__f7f2a36a-73b0-41d6-97e9-22d6de1552c4-16859892538c7f487d-1": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "title": "",
            "text": "<p>We get asked a lot of the same questions about our coffee, so we thought we’d put together a list of some of the most common ones. If you have any other questions that aren’t answered here, please get in touch!<br/></p>",
